  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 401.05 Transferring Regulated Substances",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 401.05 Transferring Regulated Substances. Regulated substances shall be transferred from or to regulated containers only under the following conditions:\n\n(a) Funnels and drip pans or other appropriate transfer equipment shall be used; and\n\n(b) Fueling or transferring shall be done only over an impervious surface.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Wq 401) #8786, eff 1-5-07; ss by #10828, eff 5-19-15; ss by #14345, eff 8-23-25, EXPIRES: 8-23-35",
